{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7667422913738819893","title":"大模型算法工程师 - 抖音用户增长","description":"团队介绍：抖音用户增长（User Growth）负责抖音、今日头条、番茄小说等多个产品的用户增长业务，建立行业领先的增长和营销技术，打造极致的用户体验。加入我们，有机会参与亿级用户场景的开发与架构工作，也有机会从数据出发，利用策略和模型为业务带来更大的助力。\n\n1、深度参与User Growth团队在AI4SE（AI for Software Engineering）、AI4DA（AI for Data Analysis）等方向相关算法的设计与研发；\n2、深入研究大语言模型（LLM）和视觉模型（VLM）的前沿技术，基于业务需求设计并实现解决方案；\n3、持续关注大模型领域的技术动态，并推动前沿技术在业务中的落地。","requirement":"1、2027届获得本科及以上学历，计算机、软件工程等相关专业优先；\n2、具备扎实的编程能力、数据结构与算法基础，具有快速学习新技术的能力；\n3、熟悉大模型（LLM\u0026VLM）训练技术，复现过业内领先工作优先；\n4、具备良好的沟通协作能力，能够与团队共同探索新技术、推进新技术落地。","job_category":{"id":"6704215956018694411","name":"算法","en_name":"Algorithm","i18n_name":"算法","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"6704215862603155720","name":"研发","en_name":"R\u0026D","i18n_name":"研发","depth":1,"children":[]},"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_52","name":"杭州","en_name":"Hangzhou","i18n_name":"杭州"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785211218328,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A181993A","job_id":"7667423329078659333","city_list":[{"code":"CT_52","name":"杭州","en_name":"Hangzhou","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"杭州","py_name":"hangzhou","mdm_code":"MDCY00000134","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChanne